<title>POLAND: Komunalny plans 3.1 mln shares for bonds.</title>
<headline>Komunalny plans 3.1 mln shares for bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Komunalny SA plans to issue up to 3,060,000 shares to be exchanged for its planned 50-million-zloty convertible bond issue, the bank said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Komunalny said it would vote on both the bond and share issues at its general shareholders meeting on April 21.</p>
<p>The bank said the new issue would increase its number of shares outstanding to up to 6,333,700.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
